    feat_adaptive_desc The system monitors your recognition speed across MCQ options, dynamically adjusting intervals to push your boundaries.
    feat_adaptive_title Adaptive Response Timing
    feat_ages_desc Content curated for different age groups from early childhood to advanced learning.
    feat_ages_title For All Ages
    feat_gamified_desc Earn XP, badges, and build streaks while mastering complex visual subjects.
    feat_gamified_title Gamified Experience
    feat_mastery_desc Dynamic XP rewards difficulty, while real-time mastery badges (Bronze, Silver, Gold) track your journey from novice to expert.
    feat_mastery_title Visual Mastery & XP
    feat_multimedia_desc Learn with images, audio, and video support for immersive training.
    feat_multimedia_title Multimedia Cards
    feat_recognition_desc Immersive identification drills designed to build instant "muscle memory" for complex visual subjects.
    feat_recognition_title Visual Pattern Training
    feat_science_adaptive_desc Intervals automatically adjust based on your recognition speed and accuracy.
    feat_science_adaptive_title Adaptive Timing
    feat_science_spacing_desc Advanced cognitive spacing model that predicts memory decay and optimizes review cycles.
    feat_science_spacing_title SuperMemo-2 (SM-2)
    feat_spacing_desc A full implementation of the SuperMemo-2 model predicts your memory decay and schedules reviews at the peak of retention.
    feat_spacing_title Cognitive Spacing (SM-2)
